## CI

Default CI runs on [{{ ci_provider }}]({{ 'https://github.com/features/actions' if ci_provider == 'github-actions' else 'https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/products/devops/pipelines' }}). Each PR runs:

1. **typecheck** — `tsc --noEmit`
2. **lint** — `eslint . --max-warnings 0`
3. **test** — Vitest with the configured coverage gate ({{ coverage_threshold }}%)
4. **build** — multi-stage Docker build (node build → nginx runtime)
5. **scan** — Trivy container scan; HIGH/CRITICAL = fail
